(t)=1, &  & g(t)=t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- System III is not a first-order linear system of ODEs since it contains the term ${x}_{1}^{2}(t).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186314794 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129314 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "66d19e98-522f-5db2-b340-0f35ba2ece23" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Linear System of Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56ae3c87-5205-5739-ac04-2edd6ab1e3ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467082} {:answer/id #uuid "e8833e18-12f2-51c2-a4ce-5f06a37c230a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467083}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e8833e18-12f2-51c2-a4ce-5f06a37c230a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467083} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce561706-d665-5400-9455-6f8ac2c51dfa" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468262} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d369480b-cb0e-501a-b658-cc0180858c31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467084} {:answer/id #uuid "4f1a27b5-8a04-5428-8bac-f0bdf1eb149b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467085}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d369480b-cb0e-501a-b658-cc0180858c31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467084} :answer-field/id #uuid "b1e5c3fc-cc1a-5cad-b00c-5be3ec0d30e4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218