h-academy-id "q-37313" :question/problem "To which of the following sets does the number $\\frac{72}{9}$ belong?\n- **I.** $N$\n- **II.** ${Q}_{0}^{-}$\n- **III.** ${Q}^{+}$\n- **IV.** $R$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "First, we note that $\\frac{72}{9}=8$ is a natural number, so it belongs to $N.$ \n\nConsequently, $\\frac{72}{9}$ also belongs to ${Q}^{+}$ and $R.$\n\nSince $\\frac{72}{9}$ is positive, it does not belong to ${Q}_{0}^{-}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, III, and IV only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186323902 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054816 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1d132801-b9cc-5c0c-a8fa-0c8b840c05bd" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Sets Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "add7b108-1f88-5419-896e-b8d3c9267fb0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467382} {:answer/id #uuid "89046d5a-7465-57a3-b094-4ccb3168ef2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467383}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "89046d5a-7465-57a3-b094-4ccb3168ef2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467383} :answer-field/id #uuid "38f16f05-5180-50c9-a98d-60c49bdba894" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468412} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "43f2d08e-8e68-52ab-807f-f21b077d21e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467384} {:answer/id #uuid "5c46b320-1218-5e57-8a99-a390aa523f8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467385}] :answer-field